\newlabel{tab:ifs_baseline}{{1}{23}{IFS ensemble interface crossing statistics pooled across 98 initializations (August 21 -- October 8, 2022; 4,900 total trajectories; 73,500 total simulation-days). Probability is the fraction of all members crossing each interface; rate is the pooled crossing rate per simulation-day. The $\lambda _0 = 1000$ hPa interface was not tracked in the IFS analysis (see text). IFS does not apply CPS tropical-structure filtering, so fractions are upper bounds on the tropical-genesis contribution}{table.1}{}}
